# Tipster picks (Option 1). One JSON object per line; lines starting with # are ignored. The paper server reads this file every 30 minutes.
# A pick becomes a PAPER bet (flat stake, TIPSTER's own virtual £100) once the match is in the free fixtures file AND Bet365's price >= min_odds.
# Football 1X2 only (market "1X2", sel "H" | "D" | "A"): that is all the free data prices. p = my stated chance; why = the reason (kept with the bet).
# {"id":"2026-11-21-arsenal-chelsea-H","date":"2026-11-21","home":"Arsenal","away":"Chelsea","market":"1X2","sel":"H","p":0.45,"min_odds":2.40,"stake":2.0,"why":"..."}
